---
import QuoteButton from './QuoteButton';
---
<section id="hero" class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="small-line"></span> Furniture with feeling</p>
    <h1>Beautifully made.<br/><em>Entirely yours.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">Thoughtful furniture for the way you live. From a favourite corner to a whole home, we make your space feel like you.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#products">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><QuoteButton client:load /></div>
    <div class="hero-note"><span>Designed around you</span><span>Crafted in Sapele, Nigeria</span></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-image">
    <img src="/assets/editorial/hero-1280.webp" srcset="/assets/editorial/hero-640.webp 640w, /assets/editorial/hero-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 52vw" width="1336" height="1888" alt="Sculptural blush sofa with warm wood detailing and curved mirrors" fetchpriority="high" />
    <figcaption><span>Soft curves. Lasting character.</span><a href="#gallery" aria-label="Discover our furniture designs">↗</a></figcaption>
    <span class="image-label">The art of feeling at home</span>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="values-strip shell"><span>Made for your space</span><span>Considered details</span><span>A personal approach</span></div>
